<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<contentList>
	<content contentuid="h5f848475g62bbg4fe3gab01g58fe0d5aed09" version="1">托姆</content>
	<content contentuid="hfc0c9ec1g498cg47d0g9bccg4a548d748756" version="1">托姆不仅是公正之神提尔的得力臂膀，更是职责、忠诚、正义与服从之神。他象征着坚忍之道，其追随者皆以骑士精神为圭臬。</content>
	<content contentuid="h377215e0gc9f7g41eagaeb1g3740c543be58" version="1">炽天神侍</content>
	<content contentuid="h613cb9c6g1a64g4fe1ga082gbf095426f807" version="1">炽天神侍乃诸天使与天界存在中最具威能者。地位仅次其主神及天界七圣，作为神祇意志的延伸，为其效忠的圣主代行神迹。</content>
	<content contentuid="h3cc8d16cg8297g4b6dgac42gc4c565adccb1" version="1">三神圣盾</content>
	<content contentuid="h1534fa8bgdacbg4428gb93fgc16217336c5c" version="1">昔日守护银辉天界非因惧恶，实为爱善。然利剑难涤世间不公——此刻你终得顿悟。</content>
	<content contentuid="h32456a38g3d18g4b99ga60dgf8cda54cad75" version="1">真实视觉</content>
	<content contentuid="h8c751428g4a93g4475gb6f4g8c8dac359d2e" version="1">你获得[1]尺黑暗视觉，永不为无光所&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLINDED"&gt;目盲&lt;/LSTag&gt;，视隐形生灵如静水墨痕。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6dd28311g98ddg4df3g9ea1g931a1f48510e" version="1">濒死状态</content>
	<content contentuid="h90b1d7e4g3cefg437egb27cg44ecd1964455" version="1">身为天界存在，你对黯蚀伤害免疫。纵是流落天堂山外的炽天神侍，濒临&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Downed"&gt;倒地&lt;/LSTag&gt;时，每回合伊始亦将恢复半数&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2d3b5bccg868dg416fg8876g1eb8ea3535e0" version="1">半位面储物：内衣</content>
	<content contentuid="h5e22e0d4g60e6g40d8ga59dg36ebf28755a1" version="1">凡人习俗确需蔽体之布，然每夜战后当褪——以免在营地留下另一道蜿蜒的血河。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0b0fa56ag3881g4e62gb3bdgcf9ee3330874" version="1">半位面储物：便装</content>
	<content contentuid="hefa2adc3gba2fg4468gaebdga25ad3a70161" version="1">古老简约的皮质束带紧贴肌肤。它柔软光洁，散发着乳皂清香，宛如拥抱的承诺——你想，或许自己正渐渐钟情于此。</content>
	<content contentuid="h98a09f8fgbef5g4659ga8acg0beee8f49ac5" version="1">拾荒板甲</content>
	<content contentuid="hccc4a4f6g15d2g4988g8db5gec70fe11dba9" version="1">从劣魔口中撬出的胸甲。天晓得它曾属于哪位提尔的信徒。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha9798258gfb95g47aagafa5gf2e4cec03371" version="1">拾荒腿甲</content>
	<content contentuid="hce80090fgb344g4d07ga009g504d0e3760c8" version="1">自蛛螯间夺下的护手。鬼知道它曾效忠于哪位托姆的虔徒。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc8a1e44dge289g4aceg9941ge96f808a736b" version="1">拾荒护手</content>
	<content contentuid="h9b7b895cgd4ddg409aga3cbg9397143ae2c2" version="1">其银丝纹饰经精心蓝化处理，来历工艺皆不可考，却如月华碎隙般攫住了你的视线。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb85685e2gca51g4505gb9f0gbb809c8b61c9" version="1">蓝化镀层</content>
	<content contentuid="h6647ae3agb2acg4f3bg8af3g26e078af2403" version="1">轻灵静默——此甲依&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Proficiency"&gt;熟练&lt;/LSTag&gt;类型赋予穿戴者叠加式&lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;护甲等级&lt;/LSTag&gt;加成：轻甲+1，中甲+2，重甲+2。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6955f89agb6a1g410cgae4agda419ccfb8da" version="1">蜜黎儿</content>
	<content contentuid="hbf078357gcf31g45ffgb57cg94aaf817823e" version="1">蜜黎儿乃音乐、诗艺、雄辩与创造之神。他象征从灵思迸发至终章落成的创作全貌，昭示生命本身亦如艺术映照。</content>
	<content contentuid="hed838097g402dg46c3gb9a7g95aa9562488c" version="1">圣使导引</content>
	<content contentuid="hc6927011g5fafg47bbgb49eg8e57bdbb27cf" version="1">神音引你追寻真善，纵使屡次赌却希望换回绝望，圣心仍燃明光。</content>
	<content contentuid="h618f9e7ag65ceg4c81g874fg573eb6432e01" version="1">炽天赐福</content>
	<content contentuid="h249593abg45e1g411dg8681gab1b1f397a77" version="1">天堂山无星之夜的一缕碎片，金辉天穹永随你身。</content>
	<content contentuid="h44c77584g5d98g40bbgb97dg9685757e5572" version="1">法术烈焰</content>
	<content contentuid="h43165ffcg6549g47feg8da2g4f2ca6d5dd82" version="1">备受称颂、觊觎、恩宠的天赋——非人人皆能如你这般驾驭法术烈焰，神眷至爱。</content>
	<content contentuid="h50aa7dabg4d90g4d06gb35cgf1da2e354f3a" version="1">引导原始魔能轰击敌人，以&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="LAR_BURNING_HOLYSolar"&gt;银焰&lt;/LSTag&gt;焚灼目标。若指定友方则毫发无伤，反恢复其四分之一&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="hf95e32dfg209cg4066gb8b6g9df6e0d14077" version="1">银焰灼烧</content>
	<content contentuid="h5e186fcfg89acg4c74ga94ag52e6ffafa8b8" version="1">每回合承受1d4光耀伤害，纵是&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Immune"&gt;免疫&lt;/LSTag&gt;此伤者亦难幸免。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc36efed5g40efg488cg9f9fg2438a6395d0f" version="1">神恩泽及未亵渎光明者。疗愈能量如潮涌过你所触生灵，恢复其全部&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;。若目标处于&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CHARMED"&gt;魅惑&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FRIGHTENED"&gt;恐慌&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PARALYZED"&gt;麻痹&lt;/LSTag&gt;或&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="STUNNED"&gt;震慑&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态，诸般桎梏皆消。</content>
	<content contentuid="h48beac2fg8a93g4229gbecdg609da37c8208" version="1">律令：愈</content>
	<content contentuid="h66df34afg44b7g43d5g9c6cg7379f33eb950" version="1">谎言入耳即辨。你的察言观色&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AbilityCheck"&gt;检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;享有&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;优势&lt;/LSTag&gt;及+10加值。</content>
	<content contentuid="hbc66bd54g6a2eg4445g84bfg276008f67e98" version="1">神性感知</content>
	<content contentuid="h5560bc0fg4e44g4a60g8dfdgbe05a93134c2" version="1">天界武具</content>
	<content contentuid="hc5e3fd80g2357g46fega6b6g62b037d2f050" version="1">炽天神侍以任何武器命中时，攻击额外造成6d8光耀伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="he9a38252geba6g4361g888cg851de4c1669d" version="1">正义天罚</content>
	<content contentuid="h15fc247dg1e74g4fd0g97acgf21376e56a90" version="1">所有武器攻击额外造成6d8光耀伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="hbb51f4adg5ac9g4a9dgbb94g9d5c3ea8f300" version="1">灵体武器：飞旋巨剑</content>
	<content contentuid="h4b935badg6426g4167ga638gc79f82eaf1d8" version="1">你谙熟战阵一如熟谙天界。可召唤浮空巨剑灵体协战，其锋所指即敌殒之处。</content>
	<content contentuid="h29cda2fag6314g443egb9dfgf6197b8e5419" version="1">巨剑挥斩</content>
	<content contentuid="hcf97cebag7834g4706g9550g38731ba8a760" version="1">炽天神侍：额外攻击</content>
	<content contentuid="h3920075bgf69dg4996gbc75gcc44c3a4af31" version="1">以辉煌之刃劈裂目标。</content>
	<content contentuid="h63f6c2b8g5b1fg4ab5g8956g479eefa81ecf" version="1">治愈之触</content>
	<content contentuid="he109db9dg2c9bg4b2dgbb50g8aee9d311961" version="1">以愈疗之手触碰生灵。目标魔法恢复8d8+4点&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;，并解除诅咒、&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DISEASED"&gt;疾病&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="POISONED"&gt;中毒&lt;/LSTag&gt;或&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLINDED"&gt;目盲&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h56ad0611ge0e3g464dgb71egb093f32368a0" version="1">侦测异界存在。法术持续期间，[1]尺内异怪、天界生物、元素、精类、邪魔或不死生物皆无所遁形。</content>
	<content contentuid="hda6badbbg9cbeg409fg9272g71127cf9fefb" version="1">反魔法力场</content>
	<content contentuid="he984a87egaa75g4f37ga957gaaa97fb70543" version="1">反魔法灵光</content>
	<content contentuid="h96519810g6f46g41e2gabf5gab4a32d4879c" version="1">创造隔绝魔能的领域。力场内法术失效，召唤物消散，实体目标对魔法伤害&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Immune"&gt;免疫&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h77d410c7g7affg400aga517gc4e886951aa1" version="1">反魔法力场正抽离角色的魔能，使其无法施法。</content>
	<content contentuid="he34fef00ge7d4g4256ga275gfcce62c4d916" version="1">银辉天堂守卫</content>
	<content contentuid="h7b84b3c1ga082g4946g8fbag4aa6d0bb7cff" version="1">角色可侦测异怪、天界生物、元素、精类、邪魔与不死生物。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2be6934ag9eabg4867g910fg2e5fb1cea7b7" version="1">异怪</content>
	<content contentuid="haf27001bgbd43g4865g890dge1c8f6890c1e" version="1">该生物为异怪。</content>
	<content contentuid="h03b18665g7d96g4643gbdeega0eadcb415c2" version="1">天界生物</content>
	<content contentuid="h48ff417eg2b7eg4fd2gb83bgdf2da3296f2b" version="1">该生物为天界生物。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2ec31e58g6ab7g4e0cgafd6g832ba67dc748" version="1">元素</content>
	<content contentuid="hf117dc29g0809g4d6dgb14cgb3615528386b" version="1">该生物为元素。</content>
	<content contentuid="h521a6f16g8c14g43abg804egc3fd87d396dd" version="1">精类</content>
	<content contentuid="h2af7ee16g0a32g49dbg9dbbg12ef3c61c30e" version="1">该生物为精类。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha1d03af5gc360g43dcg9b49g483b14f5a4d2" version="1">邪魔</content>
	<content contentuid="hd182a151g7d70g4f42gbaabg26e9077262b7" version="1">该生物为邪魔。</content>
	<content contentuid="he799caeeg8b55g4fc8g8016g5cc0ac6d0f1d" version="1">不死生物</content>
	<content contentuid="h04fb0a0cgf3b9g483cg93d1gfc82e8926316" version="1">该生物为不死生物。</content>
	<content contentuid="h3a3dfadbg3977g4270g9482ge22f45158fbc" version="1">诸神之剑手</content>
	<content contentuid="h0f75be8ag1428g492eg87b8g895e4997bb2f" version="1">重拾神力，将&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Abilities"&gt;属性值&lt;/LSTag&gt;提升至真正炽天神侍之境：力量与体质26，敏捷22，智力与感知25，魅力30。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6b52f1d0g6ff4g44ebg8e2eg0524eaf3d8ae" version="1">天界体魄</content>
	<content contentuid="h301b231agfa8fg422dg8ed0gb4ab56ed6af3" version="1">获得对非魔法源穿刺、挥砍、钝击伤害的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;抗性&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h4eef3058g0b12g4ffcg9330g60076b89b488" version="1">飞旋巨剑</content>
	<content contentuid="hb1a68abfg9a36g4f0fg9970gd0f5cd16459f" version="1">自我隐形</content>
	<content contentuid="hd9532977ge9c0g4f2ag9d6dgcc4a925d2222" version="1">&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="SoftWarning"/&gt; 仅可对自身施放。</content>
	<content contentuid="h69846f50gb56dg466dg9b81g4239675efbf6" version="1">所有武器攻击额外造成1d4光耀伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="hed7f6501g01ebg44b0g9891g8c734e57dcd6" version="1">天界武具：1d4</content>
	<content contentuid="h87e31b89gfd06g4116g9e00g2bf590a477f3" version="1">所有武器攻击额外造成1d8光耀伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1747f9cagc9e7g45c8ga7f0gfb90fa2fe909" version="1">所有武器攻击额外造成1d12光耀伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="h985cbad3gc574g484dgb4f7g522fc36cf2f3" version="1">天界武具：1d8</content>
	<content contentuid="h678a17e8gbbd4g44cag916bg808180cc7581" version="1">天界武具：1d12</content>
	<content contentuid="h37ea93cfg5dd6g462fgbfd8g09f2fd97df70" version="1">你可召引天界伟力，令日耀精芒随刃而舞。武器攻击将额外造成1d4、1d8、1d12或6d8光耀伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb6652b54g6a7cg49ecgbcfbg1e635fe77eb0" version="1">天界武具：1d4</content>
	<content contentuid="h1ce32a60gd31eg4316g9010gf2ea9d64890b" version="1">天界武具：1d8</content>
	<content contentuid="h7b523fe1g8f71g4494gb094g299295623b93" version="1">天界武具：1d12</content>
	<content contentuid="h8164dbc0g5992g488bg963fgfb94e4a2ee0f" version="1">使所持武器命中时额外造成1d4光耀伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="hf2100097gdb3dg4a79g9889g7357cd0da82d" version="1">使所持武器命中时额外造成1d8光耀伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc9a0a0e5g921fg4f4bg8faag0ef4769b0854" version="1">使所持武器命中时额外造成1d12光耀伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1e1dfee0gf2b6g47f2g874fg2ec9827ce4a2" version="1">收剑敛翼——毕竟此刻你正度假，立于托瑞尔大地之上。</content>
	<content contentuid="hce14a710g8fffg4fd5g873dgc26a9dc979e9" version="1">清除</content>
	<content contentuid="hf7eff6b4gc9b4g4a98g8296g138b25b0aefd" version="1">天界武具：炽天神侍</content>
	<content contentuid="haa3dfb25g3313g4f03ga183g8929963e58aa" version="1">使所持武器命中时额外造成6d8光耀伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha96f8151g8997g4ec2g90c9g883b196a8f15" version="1">&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="SoftWarning"/&gt; 战吼效果不可叠加。</content>
	<content contentuid="h85271ec7ge72eg4d4cg8806gf62af8a0bdf5" version="1">侦测善恶</content>
	<content contentuid="h0a0c5dfag479dg4640g842bgb6663aec58cf" version="1">耀星冠冕</content>
	<content contentuid="h3328bfffgc1fag4757gafdagb5eb2ddac635" version="1">日耀煌煌。若日轮碎片崩离晶化，此冠必是其形貌。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8582f304g27cbg41fega4d0g6fb46196c06d" version="1">此冠赋予佩戴者乐器熟练项及专注优势。</content>
	<content contentuid="h3e51013fg94d6g42efgb070g65c62b559dc6" version="1">炽天耀斑</content>
	<content contentuid="hf88cba20g9334g4eb2gbf81gbe4d1d01d080" version="1">灼热迸发</content>
	<content contentuid="hb68be301g8ffbg480fgaac8g0923c1863840" version="1">神圣威能驱散魔法黑暗。周围敌物须行敏捷&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免&lt;/LSTag&gt;，失败则受2d8火焰加2d8光耀伤害，成功则半减。</content>
	<content contentuid="h18501bbeg158cg4303g806eg83b4b766be22" version="1">预警术</content>
	<content contentuid="hf90787a2gb7d7g4717g817fg317e872d26bd" version="1">你赋予盟友预见瞬息未来之力。直至长休，目标免疫&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SURPRISED"&gt;突袭&lt;/LSTag&gt;，其&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻击检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AbilityCheck"&gt;属性检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;与&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;皆具&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;优势&lt;/LSTag&gt;。此外，他物对其攻击检定具&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage"&gt;劣势&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="hfa37349ag4a03g4f9dg87a1g8bc28dc0ce3d" version="1">神谕预视</content>
	<content contentuid="h78493f40g2a7fg4fbbg9933g1df8cd7801b4" version="1">窥见未来一隅，你免疫&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SURPRISED"&gt;突袭&lt;/LSTag&gt;，&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻击检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AbilityCheck"&gt;属性检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;与&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;具&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;优势&lt;/LSTag&gt;。他物攻击你时具&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage"&gt;劣势&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="haad48a9ag2531g461cga027g27e4e47a3dd1" version="1">凌空步</content>
	<content contentuid="he38b499fgfe8fg4e6cgb86fg3352a5826747" version="1">魔法抗性</content>
	<content contentuid="heafb3414gcca3g47c9g8091g2179f5a2e6b5" version="1">羽翼托你悬于地面分毫。免疫多数地表效果，防滑免摔，&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DIFFICULT_TERRAIN"&gt;困难地形&lt;/LSTag&gt;不滞步履。</content>
	<content contentuid="hf623dba2gbfb9g42acg8069g9aaea79b5826" version="1">炽天神侍对抗法术及魔法效果的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;具&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;优势&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
